
   AmaaraOS 1.0.0  ·  Open-PC One
   The A-Tech Corporation

   There is no login on this device. The desktop is driven by the agent,
   and the only ways in are the WSS edge on :8095 (a paired device key)
   and, on first boot, BLE provisioning.

   openpc-engine doctor      identity, engine handshake, registered devices
   openpc-engine pair-code   one-time code for a desktop client
   amaara-version            OS, slot, model and kernel in one screen
   journalctl -u openpc-engine -f

